      "value": "@{5ae243864dc68c67fe796424|full_name}: I agree that this is an issue. but I am not sure if publicly showing the emojis on the profile is the best way to solve it, there might be cases where you do not want to show your emojis to others (I cannot think off a single use case where that could be the case, but it could be one).\n\nIt might be better to show the used emojis like you mentioned, but that requires to use the emoji at least once, which doesn't entirely fix the issue.",
